    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc98CHECK THIS OUT!\ud83d\udc98</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590430/extras/368774fae5b15d4cda3c02edd5019410.avif?t=1752630418\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The  romp with girls with curves returns! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Critical Bliss and Outbreak Games join forces to deliver you Snow Daze: Redaze, an ambitious reimagining of Snow Daze: Music Of Winter. This REMAKE is made completely from the ground up with brand-new dynamic visuals, stylish artwork, and a greatly refined narrative experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1590430/extras/b3910fce0043b9f625a9aafdbf62bc6a.avif?t=1752630418\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relive a familiar setting with a revolutionary approach to visual novel scene presentation. Snow Daze: Redaze adopts a manga-like style with a variety of artwork to add more meat to every scene in fantastic detail. A newly introduced system allows deeper narrative dialogue when interacting with the characters. It won't be as easy to get the girls to fulfil Jason's fantasies, but the rewards are beyond his wildest dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200+ individuals Images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4k resolution support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully voice acted scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic conversation system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Timeline and Recollection System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extras &amp; secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brand new OST made by the <i><strong>Critical Bliss Sound Team</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam achievements</p>",
